judicial-intel/data/signals/
# judicial-intel-analytics (2026-09-19): media and regenerable data stay out.
# captions/*.vtt      ← pull_captions.py      (400 MB)   info.json metadata IS kept
# transcripts/*.turns ← build_transcripts.py  (50 MB)    hand-label truth files ARE kept
# panel/, dockets/, flcourts/, index.json, manifest.json are kept — they are the dataset.
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/audio/
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/video/
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/frames/
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/captions/*.vtt
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/captions/_urls_*.txt
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/transcripts/*.turns.json
judicial-intel-analytics/data/*/transcripts/*.srt
judicial-intel-analytics/data/pilot/
judicial-intel-analytics/__pycache__/
judicial-intel-analytics/pipeline/__pycache__/
new-kingsfield-judicial-intel-categories/src/__pycache__/
